              **Purpose:** Hard-coded "DNA catalog" of ALL ZacAi components, paths, hashes, priorities.

              ```json
              {
                "version": "1.0",
                  "components": {
                      "core-model-system": { "path": "packages/core-model-system", "priority": 1, "hash": "sha3-..." },
                          "core-memory": { "path": "packages/core-memory", "priority": 2 },
                              "orchestration-model": { "path": "packages/orchestration-model", "priority": 3 },
                                  "agents": { "vcflow": { "path": "packages/agents-vcflow" }, "llemur": {...} }
                                    },
                                      "branches": ["backup", "stable", "optimised", "experimental"],
                                        "bootSequence": ["core-model-system", "core-memory", "orchestration-model"]
                                        }
                                        ```

                                        **Kernel uses this** to know exactly what should exist and where.

